  "b4_text_layer_sanitized": "26\nIn hydrogen spectrum, the shortest wavelength in the Balmer series is λ. The shortest wavelength in\nthe Bracket series is :\n(1)\n2 λ\n(2)\n4 λ\n(3)\n9 λ\n(4)\n16 λ\n\n2\nn = ∞\nn = 4\n​ =\nλ\n1\nR\n​ −\n​\n( n\n​1\n21\nn\n​2\n21 )\n​ =\nλ\n​\nBalmer\nλ\n​\nBrackett\n​ =\n42\n22\n​ ⇒\n4\n1\nλ\n​ =\nBrackett\n4λ\n​\nBalmer\n",
